<title>USA: Delaware Finance Authority, Pa., $140 mln repriced.</title>
<headline>Delaware Finance Authority, Pa., $140 mln repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said Monday it repriced and restructured Delaware Valley Regional Finance Authority, Pa.'s $140 million bond deal.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>DELAWARE VALLEY REGIONAL FINANCE AUTHORITY</p>
<p>(BUCKS, CHESTER, DELAWARE AND MONTGOMERY COUNTIES, PENNSYLVANIA)</p>
<p>RE: $140,000,000*</p>
<p>LOCAL GOVERNMENT REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>REPRICING AND RESTRUCTURING ARE AS FOLLOWS:</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>					    70,000,000*</p>
<p>					   1997 SERIES A</p>
<p>					 CPI BASED FLOATER</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 07/07/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>07/01/2027	     70,000M    CPI +188</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: MANDATORY TENDER ON 07/01/07</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>					    70,000,000*</p>
<p>					   1997 SERIES C</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 07/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>07/01/2017	     42,000M    5.60  %	100.00</p>
<p>07/01/2027	     18,000M    5.70  %	100.00</p>
<p>07/01/2027****	 10,000M    7.75  %	  5.75</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 128.424)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>**PLEASE NOTE EXTRAORDINARY CALL LANGUAGE ON PAGE 5 OF THE POS</p>
<p>****PREMIUM CALL/LAST TO BE CALLED</p>
